# Line endings: .cmd must stay CRLF or cmd.exe mis-parses it, so pin it rather
# than letting core.autocrlf decide. Everything else is fine as LF -- PowerShell
# 5.1 reads LF-only .ps1 without complaint, and the script reads the JSON
# explicitly as UTF-8.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
